{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>His might</b> — his strength, as in: 'the beginning of my strength' (כחי וראשית אוני)." "<b>The muscles of his belly</b> — like: 'you did not cut your shoot' (לא כרת שרך)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra reads בשרירי as cognate with שרך by metathesis; the parallel phrase לא כרת שרך (Job 40:17 or similar) is adduced to support the reading."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:27.090363243Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}